# Data is tracked by DVC (`dvc add` writes its own data/.gitignore).
# Safety net so raw image files can never be committed by accident:
data/**/*.jpg
data/**/*.jpeg
data/**/*.png
data/**/*.JPG
data/**/*.JPEG
data/**/*.PNG

